# Performance Monitoring

Performance monitoring measures response time, latency, throughput, CPU, memory, disk I/O, network performance, and errors.

## Key Points

- Understand the purpose of performance monitoring.
- Identify relevant monitoring measurements.
- Use monitoring information for detection, analysis, and troubleshooting.

## Example Flow

```text
System → Collect Metrics → Analyze → Visualize → Alert → Respond
```
